You... It couldn't be...{VAR BE01}
The fact that you are here means you
came to learn about the secret{VAR BE00}
of Genesect!{VAR BE01}

We, Team Plasma, revived Genesect from
a Fossil.{VAR BE01}
Then we enhanced the Pokémon with the
power of science!{VAR BE01}

But, our lord N was not interested in
this Genesect that was modified by the{VAR BE00}
power of science!{VAR BE01}

That's what he said...{VAR BE01}
So our research was halted, and this
facility was closed...{VAR BE01}

However!!
The Genesect research is all mine!{VAR BE01}
So if you want to know Genesect's
secret, you'll have to beat me in battle!{VAR BE01}

I've lost everything...{VAR BE01}
I forgot my duty as a Scientist is
to make the world happy.{VAR BE01}
So, this must be what I get for trying to
make a Pokémon into a tool for fighting...{VAR BE01}

I'm going to wash my hands of this
Genesect matter...{VAR BE01}
I don't need this anymore...
I'll give it to you.{VAR BE01}

The item I just gave you was made
for Genesect.{VAR BE01}
When it holds an item like this, it
changes the type of the move called{VAR BE00}
Techno Blast, so it can always have{VAR BE00}
an advantage.{VAR BE01}

There is a memo stuck to the
side of the monitor.{VAR BE01}
Read it?

My lord N apparently rejected
my research...{VAR BE01}
But my research is necessary for
Team Plasma to reach its goal...{VAR BE00}
The strongest Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
The rest of the memo is torn and
impossible to read.
